{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00019","headline":"入潼关 · 太宗皇帝","name":"入潼关","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"崤函称地险，襟带壮两京。\n霜峰直临道，冰河曲绕城。\n古木参差影，寒猿断续声。\n冠盖往来合，风尘朝夕惊。\n高谈先马度，僞晓预鸡鸣。\n弃繻怀远志，封泥负壮情。\n别有真人气，安知名不名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"太宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00019.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00019","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}